@broadcast "ScrubGod 9000 - But Wait, There's More"
@category commercial
@length 30
@type commercial

::actors
@actor npc_host
@alias npc_host HOST
::endactors

::scene TITLE

ROOM kitchen_disaster

EVENT FADE_IN

TITLE scrubgod_logo

MUSIC scrubgod_stinger
♪ An upbeat, slightly too-loud synth sting, the kind that plays under people yelling about savings. ♪
MUSIC_END

::scene COMMERCIAL

CAM 1 WIDE kitchen_disaster

NPC npc_host

HOST:
Are YOU tired of scrubbing?!

ACTION npc_host holds up a rag stained with something best left undescribed

HOST:
Introducing ScrubGod 9000!

CAM 2 CLOSEUP demo_surface

SHOT
One wipe drags a clean streak across the counter, the dirty half and the spotless half glaringly, impossibly different.
SHOT_END

HOST:
One pass removes blood, rust, and most forms of regret.

OVERLAY
BUT WAIT — THERE'S MORE

CALL NOW AND WE'LL DOUBLE YOUR ORDER FOR THE SAME EXPOSURE RISK
OVERLAY_END

HOST:
ScrubGod 9000. Because someone has to clean it up, and it's not going to be them.

TICKER
Stains are not removed, only relocated to a molecular level you can no longer see · Radiation reduction is cosmetic only and has not been evaluated by anyone qualified to evaluate it · Do not use ScrubGod 9000 near open flame, standing water, or your own reflection · Second bottle ships in 6-8 lifetimes
TICKER_END

EVENT FADE_OUT

END
